---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Safeguarding & Digital Media - Omagh Harriers AC"
  description="Safeguarding policies and photo/video guidelines for Omagh Harriers Athletic Club"
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-black to-gray-900 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <a
          href="/policies"
          class="inline-flex items-center text-amber hover:text-yellow-400 transition-colors mb-4"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
          </svg>
          Back to Policies
        </a>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Safeguarding / Photo &amp; Video&nbsp;Use</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
        Safeguarding policies and photo/video use guidelines
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <!-- Safeguarding Introduction -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">While safeguarding is the responsibility of everyone within the running club (led by the whole committee), having designated Safeguarding Officers ensures the club has dedicated people with the primary responsibility for managing and reporting concerns about members at risk. They are trusted people to speak to about a concern and they will manage any concern raised in an appropriate way. Their responsibility will be to ensure the right information is shared with the right people at the right time.&nbsp;</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Our Safeguarding Officers for 2026 are <strong>Mrs Roisin McCullagh (female)</strong> and <strong>Mr Martin McIvor (male)</strong>, both of whom have undertaken appropriate training for the role.</p>
          <div class="bg-amber/10 border-l-4 border-amber p-6 rounded-r-lg my-6">
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-0">Members who wish to reach out to either Safeguarding Officer can do so in person at any club activity, or by locating their contact details via the club Whatsapp group.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Safeguarding Officers Photos -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <figure class="text-center">
              <img src="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=927" sizes="(max-width: 927px) 100vw, 927px" srcset="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=927 927w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=136 136w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=272 272w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=768 768w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=1440 1440w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg 1823w" alt="" width="927" height="1024" data-attachment-id="373" data-permalink="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/safeguarding-photo-video-use/rmc/" data-orig-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg" data-orig-size="1823,2014" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="RMc" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=272" data-large-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/rmc.jpg?w=927" class="rounded-lg w-full h-96 object-cover" />
              <figcaption class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-semibold">Roisin McCullagh</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure class="text-center">
              <img src="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/martin2.jpg?w=265" sizes="(max-width: 265px) 100vw, 265px" srcset="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/martin2.jpg 265w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/martin2.jpg?w=110 110w" alt="" width="265" height="362" data-attachment-id="329" data-permalink="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/safeguarding-photo-video-use/martin2/" data-orig-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/martin2.jpg" data-orig-size="265,362" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Martin2" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/martin2.jpg?w=220" data-large-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/martin2.jpg?w=265" class="rounded-lg w-full h-96 object-cover" />
              <figcaption class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-semibold">Martin McIvor</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Safeguarding Policies -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Omagh Harriers A.C. operates in-line with the safeguarding &amp; welfare policies of <a href="https://athleticsni.org/Safeguarding" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600">Athletics NI</a> (our governing body).</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">The following policies and codes of conduct were ratified by the Club Committee on 18th November 2024:</p>

          <div class="mt-6 mb-6">
            <p class="text-gray-700 font-bold mb-2"><strong>Juniors</strong>:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li><a href="https://athleticsni.org/download/files/child-safeguarding-policy-March-2024.pdf" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600">Child Safeguarding Policy</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://athleticsni.org/download/files/child-safeguarding-procedures-March-2024.pdf" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600">Child Safeguarding Procedures</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://athleticsni.org/download/files/child-safeguarding-process-map-2023.pdf" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600">Process Map for Concerns</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <p class="text-gray-700 font-bold mb-2"><strong>Seniors</strong>:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li><a href="https://athleticsni.org/download/files/Adult-Safeguarding-Policy-2023.pdf" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600">Adult Safeguarding Policy</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://athleticsni.org/download/files/Adult-Safeguarding-Procedures-2023.pdf" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600">Adult Safeguarding Procedures</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Other codes of conduct and policies/regulations can be located on the <a href="https://athleticsni.org/Safeguarding" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600">ANI Safeguarding page</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo & Video Use -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Photo &amp; Video Use</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Photographs / video of members may be taken from time to time during activities for a variety of uses. For example:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
            <li>Coaches may take photo / video in order to discuss form.</li>
            <li>During events to provide a record of the activity to post on social media.</li>
            <li>Submitted to the press to publicise club activities.</li>
            <li>To promote the club. For example photos are used on the club website &ndash; the banner and activities within the pages.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">We will only authorise the use of images of runners in suitable dress. Any photo / video posted must focus on the sport, not the person and be dignified.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">You can opt out of appearing in social media, website and other publicity material at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:omaghharriers@outlook.com" class="text-amber hover:text-yellow-600"><strong>omaghharriers@outlook.com</strong></a> , clearly stating your full name.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">If you do not wish to be photographed at an event, you are responsible for notifying the camera operator of your opt out status. Failure to do so may result in your inclusion in a photograph or recording and will be treated as a release, allowing Omagh Harriers A.C. to utilise the photograph or video recording accordingly.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Please note that this agreed practice only applies to activities and events led by Omagh Harriers A.C. and the club cannot accept any responsibility for digital media decisions by other clubs and organisations. For any events outside of the club, it is your own responsibility to declare your wishes to the organisers.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Logo -->
        <div class="mt-12 text-center">
          <figure><img src="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/omagh-harriers_black.png?w=408" sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px" srcset="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/omagh-harriers_black.png 408w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/omagh-harriers_black.png?w=150 150w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/omagh-harriers_black.png?w=300 300w" alt="" width="408" height="160" data-attachment-id="318" data-permalink="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/safeguarding-photo-video-use/omagh-harriers_black-24/" data-orig-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/omagh-harriers_black.png" data-orig-size="408,160" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Omagh Harriers_black" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/omagh-harriers_black.png?w=300" data-large-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/omagh-harriers_black.png?w=408" /></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
